  "ALL_TEXT": "151 INT. MODI'S PODIUM - DAY \nPrime Minister Narendra MODI is finishing up with his address \nMODI \n...Main jaanta hoon...main jaanta \nhoon...kaise kaise log mere khilaaf \nho jaayenge main jaanta \nhoon...sattar saal ka unka main \nloot raha hoon, mujhe zinda nahin \nchodenge...mujhe barbaad karke \nrahenge, unko joh karna hain \nkare...pachas saal- bhaiyyo aur \nbeheno, pachas din...pachas din \nmeri madad kare...desh pachas din \nmeri madad kare..zor se taaliyo ke \nsaath meri svaarth ko sveekaar \nkijiyegaa... \nMODI is flanked by his gunmen and security. VEDA, GOVARDHAN \nand SULOCHANA are on the podium, waiting. His PA whispers in \nhis ear and leaves. MODI now looks at our trio. He takes a \ncouple of beats and smiles. Before he continues with his \nspeech, he coughs. He calls for someone. His entourage can\u2019t \nfind the carton of water bottles. \nSULOCHANA \n(intuitively) \nGOVARDHAN nee water bottle ivvu \nGOVARDHAN \nNenu ivvanu \nSULOCHANA \nBha! Nasapettoddu! Aa water viluva \nneeku telidhu \nGOVARDHAN \nNa water viluvaa naaku enduku \ntelidhu? Anthuke ivvannu \nVEDA gets in \nVEDA \nAmey adugutundhi kada, iccheyachu \nkada \nGOVARDHAN \nMee iddaru malli kalisi nannu \nvokadini corner chestunnaara? \nSULOCHANA hands GOVARDHAN's Milton water flask. The security \nperson is about to grab it, when MODI brushes him off. VEDA \nwhispers in GOVARDHAN\u2019s ear \nGOVARDHAN \nAa neeru paarabosa ...kotha neeru \npattaadu ANJI \nMODI quenches his thirst, and gives it back to them. \nSULOCHANA \nInka rendu moodu chukkalu \nuntaai..mana mugguru taagocchu \nGOVARDHAN is about to say something when VEDA stops him. \nSULOCHANA has a sip and gives it to GOVARDHAN \nGOVARDHAN \nNenu engili taaganu \nVEDA \nSare naakivvu \nVEDA drinks what is left of it. MODI walks up to the three \nand congratulates them. Photographers huddle around. \nGOVARDHAN stays away from MODI, annoyed by everyone being so \nclose together. \nCUT TO:",
